		{
			description: [
				"&d<glitch>Quest tree is a work in progress.</glitch>&r"
				"- CelestialAbyss"
				""
				"<&ePerlica&r> We seem to have been transported to a different universe, Endmin."
				""
				"<&3Chen&r> Yeah! Everything seems so blocky too! I'll see what I can find."
				""
				"<&ePerlica&r> Do be careful."
				""
				"<&3Chen&r> I will!"
				""
				"&oChen quickly leaves to go off on her own.&r"
				""
				"<&ePerlica&r> I also seem to be unable to reach anyone in Dijiang..."
				""
				"<&6Endmin&r> The &eCore PAC&r seems to have different logic as well, very interesting. It seems that we will need to break the virtual blocks around the edge and place these... &eCore PAC Port&r blocks in their place?"
				""
				"<&ePerlica&r> That seems to be correct, Endmin. However, it seems we need specialized but primitive tools to manipulate this world's blocks. There also seems to be this screen documenting all the different recipes."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&oEndmin checks the rest of her inventory...&r"
				""
				"<&6Endmin&r> And these... Mineral Vein blocks? We can't exactly make use of them right now."
				""
				"<&ePerlica&r> Noted. While we are waiting for Chen, we should build some shelter and create basic tools."
				""
				"<&6Endmin&r>These trees don't seem to take all that much force to harvest the blocks... Punching the wood doesn't hurt either."
				""
				"&oSome time passes...&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&oChen comes running out of a nearby cave excitedly waving a pickaxe in one hand as if signaling them to come over.&r"
				""
				"<&3Chen&r> I found some Originium ore blocks in a cave here Endmin!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&oA few days pass, but time seems to move quickly in this universe with occasional differences during the night hours that ranged from being peaceful to outright being overriden by hostile entities.&r"
			]
